  "description": "Azure Blob Storage document provider for OfficeAgent.NET, which lets AI agents edit existing Word, PowerPoint and Excel files and fill templates: creates, registers, opens, and saves documents in one blob container through the Azure.Storage.Blobs SDK, with ETag concurrency and create-only writes. Agents address documents by an opaque (connectionId, documentId); the provider never exposes account URLs, container names, or credentials to the model.",
